<title>USA: Merrill wins NYS Bridge Authority $49 mln revs.</title>
<headline>Merrill wins NYS Bridge Authority $49 mln revs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said it won a $49 million New York State Bridge Authority general revenue bond issue, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.050 percent.</p>
</text>
